            "review_title": "Review at Curry House Coco Ichibanya Vincom Megamall",
            "review_text": "Anh Amắn 🇻🇳\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam\n12939 contributions\n29\nDelicious Japanese Curry in District 9\nDec 2024 • Friends\nI came here with a friend as we were both craving Japanese style curry and I had noticed this restaurant a couple of days earlier while I was out shopping.\n \nThe restaurant in the Grand Park Mega Mall is definitely a very good choice for Japanese curry, with a lot of variations available. The service is friendly and the curries we ordered were hearty in flavour and simply delicious. I think we will come back here regularly.\n\nThe prices are very reasonable too. Great place to come with friends and family.\nRead more\nWritten December 24, 2024",
